>> > linux,uefi-mmap           | 64-bit | Physical address of the UEFI memory map,
>> >                           |        | populated by the UEFI GetMemoryMap() call.
>> > --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>> > linux,uefi-mmap-size      | 32-bit | Size in bytes of the UEFI memory map
